{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2ffa97693704aafe066ba072a06d4183.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2ffa97693704aafe066ba072a06d4183.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2ffa97693704aafe066ba072a06d4183.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/f6cb9412ee72a72e15c80db07c988be9.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/f6cb9412ee72a72e15c80db07c988be9.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream ranch and tend to your horses by feeding, brushing, and caring for them daily. Whether they rest in cozy stalls or wander open pastures, it\u2019s up to you to decide what\u2019s best for each member of your herd!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/d44b958c50a27df1b507595fba392ba4.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/d44b958c50a27df1b507595fba392ba4.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/d44b958c50a27df1b507595fba392ba4.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/4ed7a25eed6da66133ca31ea139c0492.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/4ed7a25eed6da66133ca31ea139c0492.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your horses from novice to champion by developing key skills such as speed, endurance, flexibility and jump. Ride them on the open trails or in the arena to turn their potential into valuable skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/efc95ee1a6e72a594d57e8d17bd4a377.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/efc95ee1a6e72a594d57e8d17bd4a377.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/efc95ee1a6e72a594d57e8d17bd4a377.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/443176764157d429105e3bd78465f198.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/443176764157d429105e3bd78465f198.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match a mare and a stallion to raise your very own foal! Create the best pair based on skills, height and personality traits. Discover breeding exclusive coat colors and watch your herd grow with each new generation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2d0af72999e87e4fcce8d4978d829085.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2d0af72999e87e4fcce8d4978d829085.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2d0af72999e87e4fcce8d4978d829085.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/91596f855ea00ef9cca0055a0830a915.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/91596f855ea00ef9cca0055a0830a915.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ladder from beginner to expert and prove your skills in cross country events. Rise to the challenge and become your town\u2019s champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/e2ff89143c2ebe3c3fd51d481c1092b3.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/e2ff89143c2ebe3c3fd51d481c1092b3.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/e2ff89143c2ebe3c3fd51d481c1092b3.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/45a138fb565b51a522570d5a109856e4.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/45a138fb565b51a522570d5a109856e4.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the auction house daily to explore a wide variety of horses. Purchase your favorite ones or sell your own for a profit. Upgrade the auction house to unlock access to even rarer horses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/40fcb25092f8fde31003b025ac27e67f.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/40fcb25092f8fde31003b025ac27e67f.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/40fcb25092f8fde31003b025ac27e67f.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/b5196a68959f311e7364d0e3fb23b02a.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/b5196a68959f311e7364d0e3fb23b02a.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock access to new trails such as Rocky Mountain and Azure Coast, and discover the unique wild horses of each area. Catch the best ones and add them to your herd!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/08adeb3c1b6c3fd2c8b0c7f00cb2f121.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/08adeb3c1b6c3fd2c8b0c7f00cb2f121.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/08adeb3c1b6c3fd2c8b0c7f00cb2f121.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/bb6680f51bd4a416d73dad6aad5eccd2.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/bb6680f51bd4a416d73dad6aad5eccd2.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend the town\u2019s festivals to participate in gymkhana competitions, purchase exclusive mealy horses, and shop for festive tack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/48d83bc54b56189e5aaa87bb1a08e8a5.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/48d83bc54b56189e5aaa87bb1a08e8a5.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/48d83bc54b56189e5aaa87bb1a08e8a5.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/9506b518da3b030d9000057ed9e3e5c4.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/9506b518da3b030d9000057ed9e3e5c4.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hundreds of different tack pieces, including saddles, bridles, halters, blankets, leg wraps,\u00a0 and accessories. Cut and style your horse\u2019s mane and tail as it grows over time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/6cb942c54ce98270dd9ade072f3a22a3.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/6cb942c54ce98270dd9ade072f3a22a3.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/6cb942c54ce98270dd9ade072f3a22a3.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/51953160102a387bb66a9cfd3475af38.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/51953160102a387bb66a9cfd3475af38.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ranch by raising chickens, sheep, and goats! Grow your own crops and fruit orchard to feed your horses. Adopt pets to join you on the trails and help gather forage as you explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/3919cf3c5c8540dfa44a78edade6d36d.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/3919cf3c5c8540dfa44a78edade6d36d.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/3919cf3c5c8540dfa44a78edade6d36d.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/7f0ed62545b3bf362460ba1fc8aa0758.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/7f0ed62545b3bf362460ba1fc8aa0758.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the villagers and learn more about the story of your new town. Unveil the truth behind the mysterious horse that\u2019s been seen by the villagers, and uncover the long-kept secrets of Rivershine!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/aad24a08eafe67e57a8ba5125fe3f438c32cff09.jpg"},{"name":"Intermediate Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/9daa540181ee6fabe6a072051eb9986d1586b5a7.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/f96063bcb53fe12820c08ad19ce64874d6bddd20.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/651e097386ad227a18c9301e21e11f3bfd53cc4c.jpg"},{"name":"First Rodeo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/5c928e2a5cec7ded849d4df69648343fb55cc628.jpg"},{"name":"Wild Rescue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/500be2cacb5746f1cce6c49d7b89f105dd218a6a.jpg"},{"name":"Tiny Hooves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/e7680c839e3819fb11a5cebb4047c82ce83d0d22.jpg"},{"name":"Natural Talent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/a63e2a428c09c6261d3ab5ecccf70f220c573cb4.jpg"},{"name":"Cross Pattern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/8239a34c07be0436cc3a19287c2850820973b0db.jpg"},{"name":"Cross Color","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1559600/61cfa87c5cfd416f7e1aecbe7ab2f7dcb9e80eb1.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1559600?t=1748018516","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748018516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/50f6fcb60e17990604ec1ab7903c56ad6db1efd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748018516","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/50f6fcb60e17990604ec1ab7903c56ad6db1efd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748018516","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2ffa97693704aafe066ba072a06d4183.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2ffa97693704aafe066ba072a06d4183.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2ffa97693704aafe066ba072a06d4183.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/f6cb9412ee72a72e15c80db07c988be9.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/f6cb9412ee72a72e15c80db07c988be9.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream ranch and tend to your horses by feeding, brushing, and caring for them daily. Whether they rest in cozy stalls or wander open pastures, it\u2019s up to you to decide what\u2019s best for each member of your herd!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/d44b958c50a27df1b507595fba392ba4.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/d44b958c50a27df1b507595fba392ba4.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/d44b958c50a27df1b507595fba392ba4.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/4ed7a25eed6da66133ca31ea139c0492.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/4ed7a25eed6da66133ca31ea139c0492.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your horses from novice to champion by developing key skills such as speed, endurance, flexibility and jump. Ride them on the open trails or in the arena to turn their potential into valuable skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/efc95ee1a6e72a594d57e8d17bd4a377.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/efc95ee1a6e72a594d57e8d17bd4a377.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/efc95ee1a6e72a594d57e8d17bd4a377.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/443176764157d429105e3bd78465f198.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/443176764157d429105e3bd78465f198.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match a mare and a stallion to raise your very own foal! Create the best pair based on skills, height and personality traits. Discover breeding exclusive coat colors and watch your herd grow with each new generation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2d0af72999e87e4fcce8d4978d829085.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2d0af72999e87e4fcce8d4978d829085.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/2d0af72999e87e4fcce8d4978d829085.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/91596f855ea00ef9cca0055a0830a915.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/91596f855ea00ef9cca0055a0830a915.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ladder from beginner to expert and prove your skills in cross country events. Rise to the challenge and become your town\u2019s champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/e2ff89143c2ebe3c3fd51d481c1092b3.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/e2ff89143c2ebe3c3fd51d481c1092b3.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/e2ff89143c2ebe3c3fd51d481c1092b3.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/45a138fb565b51a522570d5a109856e4.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/45a138fb565b51a522570d5a109856e4.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the auction house daily to explore a wide variety of horses. Purchase your favorite ones or sell your own for a profit. Upgrade the auction house to unlock access to even rarer horses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/40fcb25092f8fde31003b025ac27e67f.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/40fcb25092f8fde31003b025ac27e67f.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/40fcb25092f8fde31003b025ac27e67f.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/b5196a68959f311e7364d0e3fb23b02a.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/b5196a68959f311e7364d0e3fb23b02a.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock access to new trails such as Rocky Mountain and Azure Coast, and discover the unique wild horses of each area. Catch the best ones and add them to your herd!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/08adeb3c1b6c3fd2c8b0c7f00cb2f121.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/08adeb3c1b6c3fd2c8b0c7f00cb2f121.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/08adeb3c1b6c3fd2c8b0c7f00cb2f121.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/bb6680f51bd4a416d73dad6aad5eccd2.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/bb6680f51bd4a416d73dad6aad5eccd2.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend the town\u2019s festivals to participate in gymkhana competitions, purchase exclusive mealy horses, and shop for festive tack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/48d83bc54b56189e5aaa87bb1a08e8a5.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/48d83bc54b56189e5aaa87bb1a08e8a5.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/48d83bc54b56189e5aaa87bb1a08e8a5.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/9506b518da3b030d9000057ed9e3e5c4.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/9506b518da3b030d9000057ed9e3e5c4.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hundreds of different tack pieces, including saddles, bridles, halters, blankets, leg wraps,\u00a0 and accessories. Cut and style your horse\u2019s mane and tail as it grows over time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/6cb942c54ce98270dd9ade072f3a22a3.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/6cb942c54ce98270dd9ade072f3a22a3.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/6cb942c54ce98270dd9ade072f3a22a3.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/51953160102a387bb66a9cfd3475af38.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/51953160102a387bb66a9cfd3475af38.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ranch by raising chickens, sheep, and goats! Grow your own crops and fruit orchard to feed your horses. Adopt pets to join you on the trails and help gather forage as you explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/3919cf3c5c8540dfa44a78edade6d36d.poster.avif?t=1748018516\" width=620 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/3919cf3c5c8540dfa44a78edade6d36d.webm?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/3919cf3c5c8540dfa44a78edade6d36d.mp4?t=1748018516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras/7f0ed62545b3bf362460ba1fc8aa0758.avif?t=1748018516\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559600/extras_big/7f0ed62545b3bf362460ba1fc8aa0758.avif?t=1748018516 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the villagers and learn more about the story of your new town. Unveil the truth behind the mysterious horse that\u2019s been seen by the villagers, and uncover the long-kept secrets of Rivershine!</p>","developers":["Cozy Bee Games"],"dlc":[2398460],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/155960